definition.message:
{{#is_alert}}
The Agent has not been able to reach the API of firewall {{device_ip.name}} for the last 5 minutes. Check that the device is up, that its management interface is reachable from the Agent host, and that nothing (a firewall rule, a proxy or a changed management IP) blocks HTTPS from the Agent to the firewall.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}
Firewall {{device_ip.name}} is answering the Agent's API requests again.
{{/is_recovery}}
